cs2assets builds on the work of several open-source projects:

- CSGO-API, counter-strike-file-tracker and counter-strike-image-tracker by ByMykel (MIT).
  https://github.com/ByMykel/CSGO-API
  https://github.com/ByMykel/counter-strike-file-tracker
  https://github.com/ByMykel/counter-strike-image-tracker
  The API generator in generator/ is a vendored copy of CSGO-API (see generator/LICENSE).
- csfloat/cs-files (Steam depot download approach used by the trackers). https://github.com/csfloat/cs-files
- SteamTracking/GameTracking-CS2, used for reference. https://github.com/SteamTracking/GameTracking-CS2
- ValveResourceFormat / Source2Viewer-CLI for decompiling game textures. https://github.com/ValveResourceFormat/ValveResourceFormat
- node-steam-user by DoctorMcKay. https://github.com/DoctorMcKay/node-steam-user
- node-vpk and @node-steam/vdf.

Counter-Strike 2 and all game assets are the property of Valve Corporation.
